    },
    {
      "displayText": "人家的瑪沙那牠呀，\n總是沒辦法維持專注。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
