      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "事到如今，只能去向\n傳說中的瑜伽大師討教了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8B523059824ECAFF0C53EA80FD53BB5411000A50B38AAA4E2D7684745C4F3D59275E2B8A0E65594E86FF0100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說傳說中的瑜伽大師會在\n5個圓圈中<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>0點的位置<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>修行。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA50B38AAA4E2D7684745C4F3D59275E2B67035728000A0035500B571357084E2D00100002FF00000600309EDE76844F4D7F6E00100002FF0000004FEE884C300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且好像會在那個圓裡面\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>最靠近蒼天之處<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14597D50CF6703572890A3500B571388E19762000A00100002FF000006670097608FD184BC59294E4B865500100002FF0000005594300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託了！幫瑪沙那找到\n傳說中的瑜伽大師吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A174E86FF015E6B746A6C9990A3627E5230000A50B38AAA4E2D7684745C4F3D59275E2B5427300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說傳說中的瑜伽大師會在\n5個圓圈中0點的位置裡面<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n最靠近蒼天之處喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
