      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "恰雷姆，\n今天的修行就到此為止吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "607096F759C6FF0C000A4ECA592976844FEE884C5C3152306B6470BA6B62542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳找我有事嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4DFF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3627E621167094E8B55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒錯，有些人會稱我為大師。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92932FFF0C67094E9B4EBA67037A31621170BA59275E2B3002001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，請問今天有何貴幹呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C8ACB554F4ECA592967094F558CB45E795462FF1F001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人家的瑪沙那牠呀，\n總是沒辦法維持專注。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA5BB67684746A6C9990A372605440FF0C000A7E3D662F6C928FA66CD57DAD63015C086CE8300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了要讓牠能夠持續專注，\n人家都有讓牠好好地吃飯，但……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E8689818B93726080FD592063017E8C5C086CE8FF0C000A4EBA5BB690FD67098B937260597D597D5730540398EFFF0C4F462026202600100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那正是原因。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A36B63662F539F56E03002001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "瑪沙那牠1天只吃1個樹果。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "746A6C9990A372600031592953EA54030031500B6A39679C3002001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃太多反而會讓身體有負擔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5403592A591A53CD800C67038B938EAB9AD467098CA064D43002001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎……怎麼會這樣～<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E20262026600E9EBC670390196A23FF5E00100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請放心。\n就由我從基礎來教起吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB653E5FC33002000A5C31753162115F9E57FA790E4F8665598D7754273002001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝妳！\n真不愧是傳說中的瑜伽大師！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D59B3FF01000A771F4E0D6127662F50B38AAA4E2D7684745C4F3D59275E2BFF0100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咪香！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54AA9999FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也要謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳\n幫我們找到了瑜伽大師！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F89818B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3000A5E6B62115011627E52304E86745C4F3D59275E2BFF0100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然不用像瑪沙那牠那麼少，\n但也許人家也少吃一點飯好了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671364E0D752850CF746A6C9990A3726090A39EBC5C11FF0C000A4F464E5F8A314EBA5BB64E5F5C1154034E009EDE98EF597D4E86300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和瑪沙那一起冥想，\n就只有人家會睡著呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
